WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:50.580
MAAM'S DECISION

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.220
Hold still. Just a little longer.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:57.930
Yes.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:03.640
It's no good.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:04.680
Even for you?

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:09.600
Whoever made this is a genius.
It's completely beyond me.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:10.730
I see.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.280
Everybody come check it out!

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.480
What's going on?!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.570
Lady Marin of the Troika...!

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:24.160
Is that Fullheal?

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:29.340
That's right. The greatest Heal Spell
that the Princess can cast.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:32.330
It can cure severe injuries.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:36.760
There. You're all better.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:40.180
Thank you so much for doing this.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.510
It's nothing. A friend in need and all.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.510
Princess.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.190
I'm so glad, Marin.

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:47.930
Sister!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.020
Leona's so amazing.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:56.570
Obviously.
She's a Sage in training after all.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:00.570
She can even use attack spells,
though not as strong as the Troika.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.700
She's truly an all-around spell caster!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:05.950
What's wrong, Maam?

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.920
I'm going to talk with Uncle Matoriv.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:12.670
Maybe he can fix my Magic Bullet Gun.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.830
Hey! Maam?!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.350
Looks like your Magic Power's increased.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.850
Don't let that surprise you!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.060
Sizz!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.110
Popp! Hang in there!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.030
Crack.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.820
Boom.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:48.910
Oh no!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.920
The Flight Spell, Levizoom.
When did you learn that?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.560
It's easy if you know Zoom!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:05.550
Levizoom.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.610
Don't get cocky.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:17.980
I may be old, but in a one-minute
one-on-one fight

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:23.400
there isn't a being alive
who can beat me at magic.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.320
Nasty old geezer!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:30.660
Hey, Matoriv, can't you teach me
some amazing spells, too?

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.330
I'm having you do basic meditation.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:38.210
But you're teaching Popp
and he's improving so much!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:45.010
Fool. You don't need to know
the same spells as Popp.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.220
Huh?!

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:48.550
How come?!

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:50.850
A Hero can do anything.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:57.350
But a Warrior is stronger,
and a Mage can do more magic.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:03.030
A Hero is a jack-of-all-trades
and master of none.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:10.160
But a Hero does possess an ultimate weapon
that no one else has.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.450
Huh?! What's that?

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.200
Isn't it obvious?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.370
A Hero's weapon is courage.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.710
Courage?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:22.420
All you need is the courage
to face any enemy. That's all.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:26.380
If you want magic,
this one will improve on his own.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:31.850
That makes a party.
That's what companions are for.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.140
Aw.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.310
<i>Courage, huh?
I suppose that's something I don't have.</i>

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:41.360
<i>A weapon of my own.
That's it. Without that...</i>

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.950
I didn't do anything yet!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.660
Your mere presence oozes salaciousness!

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.160
Then I'll just hide my presence.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:53.950
Why you...!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:01.130
Honestly, the one thing you take after
your father, Roka, is your strength.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:06.970
<i>Strength? My father's strength...</i>

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.770
<i>Papnica Kingdom is gradually rebuilding.</i>

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:15.690
<i>Hearing Dai beat the Dark Army,</i>

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.640
the citizens are returning.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.400
The temple repairs will soon be complete.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.530
After that, we can start on the palace.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.190
I see. Things seem to be going well.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.700
Which leaves us.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:34.240
The Dark Army's fortress is here
in the mountains of Guildmain.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:39.250
According to Maam, Crocodine and Hyunckel
went on a reconnaissance mission.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.080
What should we do?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:45.260
Currently, we lack weapons and manpower.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:48.670
Rather than attack,
we should focus on building our strength.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:52.340
Okay. Then let's all
go look for new weapons.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:55.260
That sounds good. Right, Maam?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.390
What's wrong, Maam?

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:03.480
Listen, everyone. I've been thinking...

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.990
I think I should go
my own way for a while.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.330
What?! How come?! Why so suddenly?!

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:18.370
With my Magic Bullet Gun broken,
I can't use spells to attack.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:22.170
Plus Leona is far better at Heal Spells.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:26.670
At this rate, I'm going end up
being a burden.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.260
That's not true!

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.180
Don't be so sure.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:31.970
Leona?

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:36.770
We'll likely be facing
far more powerful enemies from now on.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:41.060
Without greater power,
you really may end up being a burden.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.900
Leona, that's a little harsh.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.770
You never hold back, Leona.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.940
I really like that about you.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:08:00.000
That's why I thought
I should return to Romos to train.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.710
To find something only I can do.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.580
What's something only you can do?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.250
Martial arts.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.550
Martial arts?!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:12.680
Right. I figured I'd become
a Martial Artist!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.590
A Martial Artist?!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.730
Hyunckel and Crocodine have betrayed us,
and Flazzard is dead.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:34.240
With the Six Legion Commanders
now three, our forces are halved.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.540
What's that?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.080
This melody is the Reaper Flute!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:56.810
See, I told you!
Hadlar's army is falling apart!

00:08:56.810 --> 00:09:01.180
Good boy, Piroro.
You were wise to inform me.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.810
Good evening!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:14.410
Greetings, inhabitants of Sovereign
Rock Castle. Let me introduce myself.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:17.280
KILLVEARN

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:16.410
My name is Killvearn.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.280
I'm Piroro!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.580
Th-This is Killvearn?!

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:24.920
Surely you've heard of him!
The personal assassin of Dark King Vearn!

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:28.170
The deadly reaper of the Dark Army
that silently erases

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.750
those who cross King Vearn!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:35.050
And why is the reaper here
in Sovereign Rock Castle?!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.050
Has someone's incompetence
warranted a visit?

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:44.520
This is surprising, Mist.
I haven't heard you speak in decades.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.150
Surprise, surprise!

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:53.320
I've seen you remain silent for centuries
when there's nothing to say.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.400
You're the one who talks to much, Kill.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:57.950
Perhaps.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.910
<i>Do these two know each other?!</i>

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:08.090
And now, Hadlar, I hear your performance
has been slipping as of late.

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:10.290
That's right!
He's been botching things up!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:14.840
Ever since he failed to kill Dai the Hero,
Legion Commanders have fallen,

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:19.220
Romos and Papnica were reclaimed.
It's a whole mess!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:24.640
And recently, he took the whole army
and was still beaten by Dai!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:25.600
Silence!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:30.900
Is it true you let
Dai and his friends beat you?

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:36.700
The plan to kill him
is still ongoing! In time...

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:39.280
Then you'd better hurry up.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:43.580
King Vearn is a patient man,
but even he has his limits.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.910
If you should fail again...

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.580
If I fail, then what?!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:53.880
Do I have to say it? This. Get it?

00:10:55.710 --> 00:11:00.430
Then have no fear!
I'll wipe out those brats in no time!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:01.890
By my own hand!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.180
Not so fast!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:09.730
The next to fight Dai is me,
Dragon Master General Baran!

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:15.570
FULLHEAL
HEAL-TYPE SPELL

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.570
MAGIC BULLET GUN

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:21.990
Baran?!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:26.910
<i>It's too soon!
Has he already destroyed Carl Kingdom?!</i>

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.790
It's our savior Baran! How cool!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:35.300
Oh. You've been saving
Dragon Master General Baran.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.960
Then I guess there's no issue.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:42.720
Wait, Baran! In order to regain
the Dark King's trust, I should...

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:47.010
Dark Commander,
I grow tired of your excuses.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:52.940
I know why you seek
to keep me away from Dai.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.320
What?!

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.440
That boy, Dai,

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.480
is a Dragon Knight, isn't he?!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:03.530
A Dragon Knight?! From the legends?!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:06.240
<i>He finally knows!</i>

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.830
So, will you leave Dai to me?

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.500
No! No, no!

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:15.550
As Dark Commander, I order you!
You will do nothing!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:19.550
Besides, there is no proof
that he's really a Dragon Knight!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.840
I merely need to see it for myself.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.590
And I said no!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.600
Stop!

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:27.140
How dare you!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.980
I believe I know what's going on, Hadlar.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:37.150
If this Dai really is a Dragon Knight,
you can't let Baran near him, right?

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:45.330
Oh well, you can all squabble
on your own time.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.580
I'd like to finish what I came here for.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.660
That's...

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.450
the Key of Vearn!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.340
Crocodine and Hyunckel, was it?

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:59.550
Those two know the location
of Sovereign Rock Castle.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:03.760
So King Vearn ordered me
to move it immediately.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:04.970
Move it?!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.220
So that's why...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.860
It finally stands!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.580
Sovereign Rock Castle moves!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:34.500
And now, let's all enjoy
a little globe-trotting!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.210
Whee! Whee!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.300
Maam...

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:53.850
Why doesn't she just train with us?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:58.520
It's a decision she reached
after much thought.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:05.280
Besides, I've heard deep in the mountains
of Romos lives a "God of Martial Arts."

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.030
Who cares about some God of Martial Arts!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:12.960
Just let her go off and
be a Martial Artist or whatever!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:15.580
What are you so sour about?

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:20.000
Popp's actually sad
because he really likes Maam.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.340
And you can shut your mouth!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:27.340
Oh really? Then why don't you
just tell her how you feel?

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.760
You won't be seeing her
for a while anyways.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.560
For... a while...

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:40.270
It doesn't matter.
She's already into someone else.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:45.820
And that's why you're all sour?
Is that supposed to be kindness?

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:51.240
Besides, if you die in battle,
this will be your final farewell to her.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:55.830
She'll never know how you feel.
Are you fine with that?

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.580
<i>This is... our final farewell?</i>

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:02.840
<i>I...</i>

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:08.260
<i>I...</i>

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:11.050
Maam! Wait!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:16.520
And off he goes! What will happen now?!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:19.310
Leona, you're enjoying this, aren't you?

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.020
Maam!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.520
Popp?

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:28.400
What's wrong?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.280
You're going to Nayle Village
in Romos, right?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.700
I'll take you there with Zoom.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:39.870
What will he do?
Will he be able to tell her?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.710
That was mean, Leona.
To push Popp like that.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:49.090
That's not true.
I said what I said for his benefit.

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:53.930
It's not good for one's mental health
to keep things bottled up.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.220
Really?

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.430
I'm sorry, Popp.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:02.520
Huh? You're not going to Nayle Village?

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.650
You said Romos, so I thought...

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.280
Our battle isn't over yet.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:14.490
I'm not returning there until we defeat
the Dark Army and avenge Master Avan.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.160
Oh...

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:21.370
Besides, the God of Martial Arts is
said to live deep in the Romos mountains.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:25.090
I trained in the Romos mountains
with Mentor!

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:26.790
I can get there with Zoom!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.090
But...

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.210
Oh come on. We're friends, right?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.640
Okay. I guess I'll take you up on it.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:36.800
Good!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.600
R-Ready?

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.560
Zoom!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:52.240
Whoa! He even put his arm around her!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.070
Not a bad job at all!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:57.990
<i>Good luck, Maam. We'll be waiting.</i>

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.960
Ow!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.040
Sorry. My landings still suck.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.090
Huh? This isn't the Romos mountains.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:14.970
Huh?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.010
This is...

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.600
the Dark Forest?!

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:21.890
Why did we end up here?!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:24.600
Oh! This is...

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.860
where we first met!

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:28.560
Oh!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:39.870
That's right. A mental image
is the key to Zoom spells.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:43.290
I guess this place
is really important to...

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:48.380
I remember. The first thing we did
when we met was fight.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.250
I'll never forget it.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.430
<i>The timing feels right.</i>

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:00.100
<i>This is my chance to tell her!</i>

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.470
You know...

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.520
Huh?

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:04.560
You're amazing, Popp.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.810
How?

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:09.780
I mean, it took us days by boat
from Romos to Papnica.

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:12.730
Now you can come back in an instant.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.320
It's nothing impressive.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.780
When we first met, I couldn't imagine
you doing something like this.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:26.620
To be honest, at first I thought
you were just a selfish coward.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.120
I-I can't argue with that.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:35.880
<i>But, through every battle,
you grew so strong and so brave.</i>

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:39.600
<i>It made me realize
how hard you were trying.</i>

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:43.850
<i>You grew strong so fast
and learned new spells,</i>

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:47.440
and saved me again and again.

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:49.850
Even back when we fought Hadlar...

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.150
Maam...

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:57.900
That's why, after that battle,
I decided I wanted to catch up with you.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:04.370
I can't have you rescuing me
all the time, right?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.710
Popp?

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.870
It's okay, Maam. It was nothing.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.670
You don't have to feel that way at all.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:20.600
I'd gladly throw my life away
for you any time.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:21.680
Huh?

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:25.220
I want to tell you that...

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:27.600
I...

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:28.560
"I..."?

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.100
I...

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:38.360
I think you're the best companion ever!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:40.320
Popp...

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:42.740
See you, Maam.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:50.250
I promise I'll be back.
You'll be shocked how strong I become.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:55.920
If you show up looking like
some muscle-bound gorilla,

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:57.800
I'll pretend I don't know you.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:01.390
You're already not much to look at now.

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:03.220
W-What?!

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:10.730
Best of luck out there!
Try not to become a muscle-bound gorilla!

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.570
Thank you, Popp.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.320
<i>This is how it should be!</i>

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.530
<i>I can't tell her yet!</i>

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:27.530
<i>I'm not at strong or brave
as she thinks I am!</i>

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.250
<i>I need to get even stronger!</i>

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.290
What do you think will happen?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:38.220
I think there's a 70 to 80% chance
that he gets shot down.

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.920
You really are enjoying this.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.640
W-What?!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.810
Sovereign Rock Castle is gone!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.810
How is this possible?!

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:50.770
Look there!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.770
Sovereign Rock Castle has moved!

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:59.530
Are you saying the castle
sprouted legs and walked away?!

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:02.300
It's not entirely impossible...

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:05.610
considering Dark King Vearn's
Supercharged Dark Energy.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:11.830
Crocodine, you need to inform
Dai and the others of this.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.330
And what about you?

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.750
I'm going to follow
those giant footprints.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:21.960
I feel something terrible
is going to happen.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.550
Where are we?

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:29.050
Almost at the northernmost land
known as the Field of Death.

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:31.020
Things are smooth, Captain.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.770
What was that?!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.730
That was close.

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:54.040
It's huge! It's enormous!

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:58.830
A giant made of rocks!

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:25.900
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:33.000
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:44.090
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:46.630
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:52.720
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:52.760
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:57.430
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:57.480 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.650
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:08.110
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:19.250
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:38.430
<i>Seeking new weapons, Dai and his friends
head to Bengarna Kingdom.</i>

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>Their first time in a department store,</i>

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:46.440
<i>Dai and Popp are excited
by all the unfamiliar foods and items.</i>

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:53.410
<i>Little do they know
that a new threat approaches.</i>

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:56.160
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:57.920
<i>"Off to The Department Store"</i>

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:00.080
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
